{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
Play in '''Group B of the [[1990 FIFA World Cup]]''' completed on 18 June 1990. [[Cameroon national football team|Cameroon]] won the group, and advanced to the second round, along with [[Romania national football team|Romania]] and World Cup holders [[Argentina national football team|Argentina]]. The [[Soviet Union national football team|Soviet Union]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/90full.html |title=World Cup 1990 |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

